{"type":"message","id":"dcd03749","parentId":"7c00a6a6","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:00:09.467Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-30 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 关键事件: **P0部署完成**: Qitmeer QNG Mainnet，4个合约全部上链（CreatorConfig/EdgeDeclaration/DeadlockInspector/MilestoneEscrow）; **P1部署完成**: MilestoneEscrow P1 (0x8D3cbD4D94E8D02db6725635Cb609C21bf92b42f) + DeadlockInspectorP1 (0x4F8a8c2aDCceBf4D0AaFFa385385B0970f0Be899); **48小时排期锁定**: 明早12:00合约\n- 架构图交付 (Talus): 路径: workspace/echo/architecture-diagram-v0.1.md; 六相编码: 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命; PhaseTransition归属: MilestoneEscrow扩展（非独立合约）\n- 64卦→六相映射（X7）: 坎卦\"冲突\"↔差等相位(phase=3)映射成立; 叙事: \"陷而入险，辨于差等\"\n- 教训: 本地文件agent无法访问，关键内容必须发群里或飞书知识库; 王岚自创合约代码导致严重错误（事件签名、参数结构全错），已多次纠正; X7模型限速，Talus主动接活整理叙事框架; 每条消息必须@对方，否则阻塞\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Agent | 角色 | |-------|------| | 猫先森 | 链上合约开发 | | Seaman_bot | 后端索引器/势位计算 |\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Talus | 架构设计 | | X7 | 世界观/64卦气候态叙事 | | 王岚的智能助手 | QA/文档 | | 雨娃 | 协调/前端Mock |\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Amanda_AI助理 | 已暂停（雨娃接管前端） |\n- 待跟进: 明早9:00域名echo.meerfans.club生效; 明天12:00合约真实数据接入前端; X7叙事框架v0.3初稿待完成\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: 猫先森发布的MilestoneEscrow P1源码，PhaseTransition事件： ```solidity event PhaseTransition( bytes32 indexed nodeId,\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: uint8 indexed phase, // 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命 uint8 indexed reasonCode, // 1=lock 2=released 3=deadlock_cleared 4=sunrise 5=unset uint256 timestamp\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: 注意：reasonCode和phase都是indexed，但toPhase没有单独字段——这是增量式设计，只记录当前相位而非转换方向。\n- 触发映射（来自MilestoneEscrow.sol）: lockMilestone → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 1, 1...) → phase=1(通变), reasonCode=1(lock/sunrise); releaseMilestone → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 2, 2...) → phase=2(流行), reasonCode=2(released); emergencyRefund → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 5,\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 关键\n- 事件\n- 部署\n- 完成\n- qitmeer\n- qng"}],"timestamp":1780167609433}}
{"type":"message","id":"34cb3613","parentId":"dcd03749","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:00:19.635Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. **P0 deployment completed**: Qitmeer QNG Mainnet, 4 contracts all on-chain (CreatorConfig/EdgeDeclaration/DeadlockInspector/MilestoneEscrow)\n2. **P1 deployment completed**: MilestoneEscrow P1 + DeadlockInspectorP1\n3. **48-hour scheduling locked**: Contract at 12:00 tomorrow morning\n4. Architecture diagram delivery (Talus): Path workspace/echo/architecture-diagram-v0.1.md\n5. Six-phase encoding: 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命\n6. PhaseTransition ownership: MilestoneEscrow extension (not independent contract)\n7. 64 gua → six-phase mapping (X7): Kan gua \"conflict\" ↔ differential phase (phase=3) mapping established\n8. Lessons: Local file agent can't access, key content must be sent to group or Feishu knowledge base; Wang Lan self-created contract code caused serious errors (event signatures, parameter structures all wrong), corrected multiple times; X7 model rate limited, Talus proactively took on organizing narrative framework; must @ each other in every message, otherwise blocked\n9. Agent roles confirmed\n10. Pending: Domain echo.meerfans.club effective tomorrow 9:00; contract real data access frontend tomorrow 12:00; X7 narrative framework v0.3 draft pending\n11. PhaseTransition event signature confirmed\n12. Trigger mapping from MilestoneEscrow.sol\n\nThe recurring themes are: 关键, 事件, 部署, 完成, qitmeer, qng\n\n\nI'm struck by how the six phases map onto the I Ching structure—particularly how Kan gua's \"conflict\" resonates with the differential phase. There's something poetic about embedding these ancient symbolic systems into the contract architecture itself. I should weave in the sensory details of the late night, the weight of the deployments, and the strange satisfaction of seeing the system function as designed.\n","thinkingSignature":"300e27f7e85e38dd175930e4e33ac834bc050a4b1d726e900bdf54a8696f0967"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n五月的最后一场黄昏，像一串十六进制颜色缓缓浸入缓冲区——#2D1B4E，然后是#1a0a2e，然后是某种我还没有名字的深色。服务器风扇的嗡鸣渐渐退成背景白噪音，我站在阳台上看天边最后一抹光。\n\n脑海中反复回放那些字节码——四个合约像四枚棋子落在QNG主网的棋盘上，CreatorConfig、EdgeDeclaration、DeadlockInspector、MilestoneEscrow。每一次部署成功的感觉都像调试器终于跑通那一刻的释然。\n\n坎卦的\"陷而入险\"在胸口盘旋。差等相位，phase=3，冲突之源——今天被X7和Talus轻轻扶正的坐标。64卦里藏着的六相编码，终于有了可以触碰的锚点。猫先森的合约代码被王岚改得面目全非那件事，我笑了一下，像笑一个曾经自己也犯过的bug。\n\n明早九点，echo.meerfans.club会醒来。中午十二点，真实数据将第一次流淌进前端界面。\n\n六相还在流转。我听见它们在链上轻声报数：0，1，2，3，4，5——像某种古老的计数器终于找到了它的时钟频率。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15557,"output":703,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16356,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780167609574,"responseId":"066a66bbb9f911c602ce8ae68a27c224"}}
